  "name": "LFI VLFI fresh-holder reward reset",
  "summary": "VLFI_8's claimRewards() runs cleanUserMapping(), which zeroes the caller's rewardDebt on its first claim, so any fresh address holding VLFI is paid the pool's whole accumulated reward per share on its balance. The attacker staked LFI, then repeatedly claimed and transferred the VLFI to a newly created contract that claimed again, restaking proceeds to grow the stake.",
